      "row_index_0based": 18,
      "serialized_row_index": 18,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "遺跡を探索中、シルバさんが顔色が優れない事に気が付いた。\n迷路のような遺跡に、疲れてしまったのだろうか。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "9471afb1a82cc489efd1f553482b69027911f8e5634bf7b6f4f798c599f4cdbf",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 2,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "シルバさん、どうかしましたか？\nなんだか調子が悪そうですが……。",
      "jp_sha256": "702b24029eec4accffbd86529fce1008132967d73934b62f5f3166066f7642b3",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "실바 씨, 무슨 일 있으세요?\n왠지 상태가 안 좋아 보이는데…….",
      "message_index_0based": 2,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 20,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b001-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
