    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "6930b18ac76f79c08f7e077f4c6c95d8a02124f6f33704e7b30c072b731d441c",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 4,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "言いながら肩を回すシルバさんは、本当につらそうに見えた。\n何とかしてあげたいという思いが湧き上がってくる。",
      "jp_sha256": "ed14b696aa206190bfd22fa1e75c7ead596ac6f2d2756d5a4ee2e7a08a1c4ab0",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "말하면서 어깨를 돌리는 실바 씨는 정말 괴로워 보였다.\n어떻게든 해 주고 싶다는 마음이 솟아올랐다.",
      "message_index_0based": 4,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 22,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b001-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "b239f79f25d40d5d72e4538b572258aca8ffcac7e2bb6a9f9580494288645236:000002_8513537780737648324:g0:r21",
      "row_index_0based": 21,
      "serialized_row_index": 21,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "言いながら肩を回すシルバさんは、本当につらそうに見えた。\n何とかしてあげたいという思いが湧き上がってくる。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "4529c7ed7697e7346754ae3360ab1ab0d4aed24df8af9e0b7d5df2009346f55b",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 5,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "じゃあ、肩をお揉みしましょうか？\n僕なんかの力じゃ、あんまり解せないかもしれないですけど。",
      "jp_sha256": "134203202d6efeaf9f05ba1ce938322cdc568690f280bab5a0881db96fe7fa3a",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그럼 어깨를 주물러 드릴까요?\n제 힘으로는 별로 안 풀릴지도 모르지만요.",
      "message_index_0based": 5,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 23,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b001-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
