      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "b239f79f25d40d5d72e4538b572258aca8ffcac7e2bb6a9f9580494288645236:000002_8513537780737648324:g0:r22",
      "row_index_0based": 22,
      "serialized_row_index": 22,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "じゃあ、肩をお揉みしましょうか？\n僕なんかの力じゃ、あんまり解せないかもしれないですけど。"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "5a081c59b8e2d480ff6c460083a7fa15e5defaa23766aa0abe1fbb35ffc982f2",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 6,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "いい――のか？\n助かる――よろしく――――頼む。",
      "jp_sha256": "aac1d28c2a74dc9c73fd892036907e7ed4d3212e53865ced52c33990ab48c84e",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그래도―― 되나?\n살겠군―― 잘―――― 부탁한다.",
      "message_index_0based": 6,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 24,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b001-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
