    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "86c5a0d3bb82ffd5745982013d0e26900f307d421ed04944a7c7237f17e82110",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 7,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "シルバさんがこちらに背を向けて座った。\n女性の体に触れるのは少し緊張したが、\n意を決して彼女の肩を揉み始める。",
      "jp_sha256": "2923c7c43808091e29e785c595d3fa3f1ecff201b62e38c7581cd9914199a58d",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "실바 씨가 내게 등을 보이고 앉았다.\n여성의 몸에 손을 대는 건 조금 긴장됐지만,\n각오를 다지고 그녀의 어깨를 주무르기 시작했다.",
      "message_index_0based": 7,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 30,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b001-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "b239f79f25d40d5d72e4538b572258aca8ffcac7e2bb6a9f9580494288645236:000002_8513537780737648324:g0:r29",
      "row_index_0based": 29,
      "serialized_row_index": 29,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "シルバさんがこちらに背を向けて座った。\n女性の体に触れるのは少し緊張したが、\n意を決して彼女の肩を揉み始める。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "9da77ff015960174bb9016dd8adfa559bcbe11bb7e943c972fa43bc7f36604c6",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 8,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "おぉ――気持ちいい――ぞ。\nなかなか――うまいじゃ――ないか。",
      "jp_sha256": "c5ef80729e05f850b36a4a7aa191df18a9917e2ca7058d0cb2b9384eaac0063e",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "오오―― 기분 좋다――.\n제법―― 잘하지―― 않나.",
      "message_index_0based": 8,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 32,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
