    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "60fdecd14015427015773b4c81961a374738f6e6032746af94f77c76df0e0f34",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 9,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "そうですか？　えへへ。\n結構凝ってますね――肩、凝りやすいんですか？",
      "jp_sha256": "9b5c4e1519b0d297ef4716fc3b232b864cd4c5977336edff4a901ea6976f9c01",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그래요? 에헤헤.\n꽤 뭉쳤네요―― 어깨가 잘 뭉치는 편인가요?",
      "message_index_0based": 9,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 33,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b001-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "b239f79f25d40d5d72e4538b572258aca8ffcac7e2bb6a9f9580494288645236:000002_8513537780737648324:g0:r32",
      "row_index_0based": 32,
      "serialized_row_index": 32,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "そうですか？　えへへ。\n結構凝ってますね――肩、凝りやすいんですか？"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "655acaa169581933fb8af563a83636ae4c359fb2d68032fe8ea57b5a3da6481a",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 10,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "あぁ――。\nこれのせいで――こんなに肩が凝るん――だ。",
